## Our Commitment to You

By allowing Carnegie Museums to collect your information, you permit us to inform you of exciting new exhibitions, programs, membership offers, and opportunities to support the museums and our services. Carnegie Museums respects your privacy and implements reasonable measures to protect the information we collect from you. Our privacy practices allow our donors, members, online program participants, and visitors to manage the personal information we collect from them in certain circumstances. Please take time to review our privacy policy, below, to understand how you might be affected by our privacy practices, and make an informed decision as to what type of information you are willing to provide.

If you have questions or comments about the privacy of the information you provide or that we collect in other ways, contact Carnegie Museums.

Email: membership@carnegiemuseums.org

